{"id":70162,"date":"2025-12-15T21:34:26","date_gmt":"2025-12-15T20:34:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70162"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:02:03","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:02:03","slug":"trail-serra-daire","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-serra-daire\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Serra Daire 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Serra Daire 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Serra Daire 2027<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>24 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partidas e meta instaladas na sede do <strong>GCDR Bairrense<\/strong>, na localidade de <strong>Bairro<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Our\u00e9m<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Certificada pela <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA)<\/strong>, a prova integra oficialmente os <strong>Circuitos Nacionais de Trail Longo, Trail Sprint e Jovem<\/strong>, afirmando-se como uma das grandes cl\u00e1ssicas de inverno do calend\u00e1rio nacional de corrida de montanha.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Desenhado em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o e orla do <strong>Parque Natural das Serras de Aire e Candeeiros<\/strong>, o evento desafia-te nos terrenos calc\u00e1rios e trilhos t\u00e9cnicos do maci\u00e7o estremenho, com vistas panor\u00e2micas sobre o vale do M\u00e9dio Tejo e o planalto de F\u00e1tima e Our\u00e9m. Tens \u00e0 tua disposi\u00e7\u00e3o quatro percursos distintos: o exigente <strong>Trail Longo de 38 km<\/strong> (2000m D+, partida \u00e0s 08:00), o <strong>Trail Curto \/ Sprint de 18 km<\/strong> (650m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:00), o <strong>Mini-Trail de 12 km<\/strong> (450m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:30) e a <strong>Caminhada de 12 km<\/strong> (300m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:35), todos com tempo limite global de 8 horas.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Sob a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta da <strong>Serra D\u2019Aire Trail Team<\/strong> (sec\u00e7\u00e3o de trail running do <strong>Grupo Cultural Desportivo Recreativo Bairrense<\/strong>) e da <strong>ACROM \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural Recreativa do Outeiro das Matas<\/strong>, a prova garante-te cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es validadas at\u00e9 10 de janeiro de 2027), pr\u00e9mio finisher, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos com servi\u00e7o de transfer, possibilidade de solo duro na v\u00e9spera e o tradicional refor\u00e7o de meta com bifana e caldo verde. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sede do GCDR Bairrense, Bairro, Our\u00e9m, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 2