d: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/storage\/events\/trail-serra-daire-2027\/regulamento_pt_1792389993.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Longo<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Longo (TL) 38 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00 \u2022 2000m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial:<\/strong> 27,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 17\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Curto \/ Sprint (TC) 18 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 650m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial:<\/strong> 23,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 17\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Mini-Trail<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini-Trail (MT) 12 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 450m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 17\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada (C) 12 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35 \u2022 300m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 17\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando, onde e a que horas s\u00e3o as partidas do Trail Serra Daire 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 24 de Janeiro de 2027, com partida e chegada na sede do GCDR Bairrense, em Bairro (Our\u00e9m, Santar\u00e9m). O Trail Longo (38 km) parte \u00e0s 08:00 (controlo \u00e0s 07:45), o Trail Curto (18 km) \u00e0s 09:00 (controlo \u00e0s 08:45), o Mini-Trail (12 km) \u00e0s 09:30 (controlo \u00e0s 09:15) e a Caminhada (12 km) \u00e0s 09:35.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 00:00 de 17 de Janeiro de 2027 com os valores de 27,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo (38 km), 23,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto (18 km), 17,00 \u20ac no Mini-Trail (12 km) e 17,00 \u20ac na Caminhada (12 km). Inclui dorsal, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica promocional (garantida para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 10 de Janeiro de 2027), pr\u00e9mio finisher, abastecimentos e refor\u00e7o de meta com bifana e caldo verde.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado est\u00e1 instalado na sede do Grupo Cultural Desportivo Recreativo Bairrense (Bairro, Our\u00e9m) e funciona no s\u00e1bado, 23 de Janeiro de 2027, das 18:00 \u00e0s 21:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 07:00 \u00e0s 09:00. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece alfinetes, devendo cada participante levar alfinetes pr\u00f3prios ou porta-dorsal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite, material obrigat\u00f3rio e log\u00edstica de banhos e solo duro?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir as provas \u00e9 de 8 horas. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, dorsal vis\u00edvel, recipiente para l\u00edquidos (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos postos de abastecimento), reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo 0,5 L), manta de sobreviv\u00eancia (nos tr\u00eas trails) e apito (obrigat\u00f3rio nos 38 km). H\u00e1 banhos na sede do GCDR Bairrense e no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Caneiro (com transfer a cada 20 minutos) e solo duro mediante pedido pr\u00e9vio por e-mail para serradairetrailteam@gmail.com.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Trail Serra Daire 2027 e em que circuitos est\u00e1 integrado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Serra D\u2019Aire Trail Team (sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Run do GCDR Bairrense) em parceria com a ACROM \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural Recreativa do Outeiro das Matas, contando com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA) e integrando os Circuitos Nacionais de Trail Longo, Sprint e Jovem.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Serra Daire 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sede do GCDR Bairrense, Bairro, Our\u00e9m\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Our\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Serra D\u2019Aire Trail Team (GCDR Bairrense) e ACROM\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando, onde e a que horas s\u00e3o as partidas do Trail Serra Daire 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 24 de Janeiro de 2027, com partida e chegada na sede do GCDR Bairrense, em Bairro (Our\u00e9m, Santar\u00e9m). O Trail Longo (38 km) parte \u00e0s 08:00 (controlo \u00e0s 07:45), o Trail Curto (18 km) \u00e0s 09:00 (controlo \u00e0s 08:45), o Mini-Trail (12 km) \u00e0s 09:30 (controlo \u00e0s 09:15) e a Caminhada (12 km) \u00e0s 09:35.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui o kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 \u00e0s 00:00 de 17 de Janeiro de 2027 com os valores de 27,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo (38 km), 23,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto (18 km), 17,00 \u20ac no Mini-Trail (12 km) e 17,00 \u20ac na Caminhada (12 km). Inclui dorsal, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica promocional (garantida para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 10 de Janeiro de 2027), pr\u00e9mio finisher, abastecimentos e refor\u00e7o de meta com bifana e caldo verde.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado est\u00e1 instalado na sede do Grupo Cultural Desportivo Recreativo Bairrense (Bairro, Our\u00e9m) e funciona no s\u00e1bado, 23 de Janeiro de 2027, das 18:00 \u00e0s 21:00, e no domingo, dia da prova, das 07:00 \u00e0s 09:00. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece alfinetes, devendo cada participante levar alfinetes pr\u00f3prios ou porta-dorsal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite, material obrigat\u00f3rio e log\u00edstica de banhos e solo duro?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir as provas \u00e9 de 8 horas. \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, dorsal vis\u00edvel, recipiente para l\u00edquidos (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos postos de abastecimento), reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo 0,5 L), manta de sobreviv\u00eancia (nos tr\u00eas trails) e apito (obrigat\u00f3rio nos 38 km). H\u00e1 banhos na sede do GCDR Bairrense e no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Caneiro (com transfer a cada 20 minutos) e solo duro mediante pedido pr\u00e9vio por e-mail para serradairetrailteam@gmail.com.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o Trail Serra Daire 2027 e em que circuitos est\u00e1 integrado?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Serra D\u2019Aire Trail Team (sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Run do GCDR Bairrense) em parceria com a ACROM \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural Recreativa do Outeiro das Matas, contando com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA) e integrando os Circuitos Nacionais de Trail Longo, Sprint e Jovem.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70163,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-70162","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ourem-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-serra-daire.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70162","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"hr